      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'The deflector character.


        Deflects incoming projectiles back
        and forth.


        Performing a poor deflect results in minor stamina lost,
        that can be recovered with a perfect deflect.


        Choose a pair of
        skills that enable a variety of different archetypes.


'
