      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Each player chooses from 2 different skills.


        Skills drain
        stamina in a variety of different ways.


        Stamina usage can be avoided
        with Foresight.


        All skills can be cancelled into the other equipped
        skill.


        Sustain Type - Can use other actions while this skill is
        active.


        Declare Type - Cannot use other skills.'
